      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why monolithic\n\u2022 one deployable, one process\n\u2022 UI + API + inference share memory\n\u2022 switch model = restart with\n  another ADF_SYSTEM\n\u2022 scale = run more copies\n\u2022 no database, no JEV",
      "originalText": "Why monolithic\n\u2022 one deployable, one process\n\u2022 UI + API + inference share memory\n\u2022 switch model = restart with\n  another ADF_SYSTEM\n\u2022 scale = run more copies\n\u2022 no database, no JEV",
